node_modules/
# Generated: music.wav by `pnpm video <project> music`, stills and single shots for review.
projects/*/public/*.wav
projects/*/out/stills/
projects/*/out/shots/
projects/*/out/sketches/
# Source footage of real people stays out of the public repo; BRIEF.md says where it comes from.
projects/*/public/*.mp4
# A song made by a music model is not ours to hand out as a file: the song's source file (mp3) is not
# committed. The finished films committed in out/ do carry the whole song
# (see projects/2026-11-github-101/NOTICE.md).
projects/*/public/song/*.mp3
